{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 934,
  "batch_count": 1655,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "9c226cba1af606e532633417d9bfcf7f7d66a4bf",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3191f78640196044b2a59f83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道时若身处后方\\n速度提升,并稍微提升加速度\\n＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dda6661bf53d027fd979f4b810138d63f6be730d4a9d62e8cb623aa612e5b10",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f0a22f94f53e60c59f62dcb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于中间集团往后时\\n加速度提升,并且在剩余200m处\\n稍微提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "737b07738d5e153e513fce0d5b42adf621743661b712446531c47b20508fc180",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3792e6846db60bc32a2cc07d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘加速度提升\\n并且在剩余200m处\\n稍微提升速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe1b613a9bea916a906772a348bc1184f4e185cf0e800be5bbb5a1669955779",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6de50aff079934bb3c6c784a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时位于队伍中后方往后\\n则速度大幅加快\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "becee187b98c47be88f28d0b490afd5ae1fdaae3b39b210a8b426a1f1f89c899",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3323990de6111bf30d4082b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘位于后方时\\n速度提升,加速度稍微提升\\n＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40ae2c02a554df9843da1e22d49925f3af4104f80ee26971666eaf8b473894d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff182e71ab9e36c4388d6a8d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段若从后方进行了超越\\n剩余150m后自身位于前方时\\n在短时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "33fb19105fd8e53f587193202f62abe982425a1951c315ccfc9c2ad44db1482b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10541"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97af0f93b3120f2d1481d5a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时\\n速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1553332ec8a74081f081df6cf5341aff145e64c744cc0ea98b5a4202215eb1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fb7fa6378a1936706cc9896",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d15d89bbe98e48f61fa6932c7f38a104daf110f5389b3354de973ba05dbdd87a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105501121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4144b4e4fa6bb2661a72c048",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺阶段前方拥挤时,会更擅长回避\\n若距离终点尚远,则稍微再向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdc699840504985ba172a089ba762f06fcdf7ab54fc21c1303c60ccb108afd60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433a2cc39dc6d7da969388d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2000m以上的比赛中，比赛期间\\n发动13次技能后会向前冲出\\n天气为晴时则会巨量向前冲出\\n＜作战·居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4259cf61c386a667084e815e074d5a4d5fccb9cce3a211226d4d89584b5d3f80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105502111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afa3a2face6810c21d34cdb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "智力足够高时，智力和速度\\n会提升，若场地状态为「良」\\n则会巨量提升＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "389b301d31e5461de89444a12a856c2fe8ad59756890b4e5fda6bb6d92e45f64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dff950ad2b422ab40edfc43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时的一段时间内\\n速度持续提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ede62bc768c35f2fd4dc2a3860302c5c4d4bcb3f1ac538aa2336dbdaeadd96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e941548da51f03183ecc74a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "枠号为7的倍数时\\n会发生非常好的事情",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ee3871a2dffb2e45f5aa0486b6ac933a4fe94d4b93eab662cc6b54810a90e77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77f0e0b15387fdf88e4c0a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘完成超越时,一段时间内\\n速度持续上升,加速度持续\\n微幅上升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "815ccdac2da2dc28610e8944d36ab785a8a022739f2be87cdd78bbd3c45a9b74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105602111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb48161e272163efea8df134",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘试图超越时\n加速度稍微提升，之后在最后冲刺\n过程中试图超越时\n持续一段时间提升速度<长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "7645e8c9940e8e70f50a45d35d8caed1952bcf0d6a31b96d205da3064cece9fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105602121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45fc5dfb54824b78c4b4de9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道上身处内侧时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "26757f0065f6b2ab87e9614d4edc1ed1dda08e3dfd113a7d5a3b869a8e9b8c6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105602211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90afcb49cdbc43cb62a2216d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘前方受阻时\\n能够借助预言之力开辟道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "7faf7001c95398ff4f3f03bf264663b1c7fc6fe4636ef7c1719b105570651bd7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8df17963070ff8814c9895d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前的第三弯道上时\\n若身处后方,会向前大幅突进\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "09e9aa1cba8af04c4e6d05969906be17274008293059857f8dca96f37895d620",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57cf402bbcae40fd33812e21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时若身处直线\\n大幅提升加速度\\n并且视野变得稍微广阔＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd433095376904c1235d604dd3dc9eb746c0cacc629b4be5401683dada48241",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f72b2703e852d2817a17b60d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘前段较早进入直线时\n或在终盘初段的较早时机\n提升加速度＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c5537eac4c0a9de78c7afcc4bcefca9a02ad6b6a65010bb11d88548385faa5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105701221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01a9e7c0902b4c239581e3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道之前的第三弯道处\\n向前突进、若在比赛后半段进行过超越\\n则变为一段时间内向前突进＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6103e44ca3eebbd30a3a219d642946af4ec84bb06cec582c3c1510f9963061b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b6e5ae219c3c73165ba46ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘初期的更早时间点\\n提升加速度,若发动技能时\\n位于中后方,则变为大幅提升加速度＜追赶・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d0bb154817cdbc8d2721bc2f6443d2c2b8b31e7006815d19d89af09e113452",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7bf16116893a9fcdfcbd1ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17ff703477351c015b7ff8d61dbc9b485c5744c28acc899e81c3eec3af755b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6382c2c74044fbf97247ebfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘完成超越时\\n回复持久力,并稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ed292a84d778b4f053b0dfaefd16e8f1c16053bcca8efa12eaeb0f2eb32f83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:966ab896c6b388c8704be8db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若身处前方\\n提升加速度,并稍微回复持久力\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5787f5f6d3a64af30e468943216fb500d3aea452f37bdee80d1fb8621b95f71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105802111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:732e8b0b50afad9dcb21e8ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于前方时\\n提高加速度,之后在最终直线\\n速度稍微提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6495a7befcbb5f3178770d04d5e30885652f750a30434f600337c81484eff352",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105802121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed9eb972199b4e4f178d4a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处弯道时回复持久力\\n同时稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "04b6cfd8cbcc6a397717884fb318d908985b2213b5f117f393c765eaf690d216",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105802211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d795b2804e510f88213761e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处后方\\n则稍微向前突进,并且剥夺前方\\n赛马娘的持久力＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e2cfed65cd7bc140314def873f04a6f2d9a6705aae1ef9171c2d47c0debab5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e992642c16285ecd8c4fae37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘一段时间内\\n向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f06956601f1a3ad444419e401f802ad9882cb648a4559944347a1848853543",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105901121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59a57f521a967f064f332e63",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "非常擅长京都竞马场\\n速度、耐力和智力大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aef849f96b1a9e3aecf4a7df873e72e6c14136f3ec668b65df99ede7845b7ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e788fe6b2e9e65616dc7c13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半阶段时若身处中间集团\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n并且微幅提升加速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5be81a590c3080fe3d690f2bafdbf6cc53adb4a53763b6b2e85b9d1ecd2cfe68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105902111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e699489eb3b9df625f81b1b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段迅速向前突进\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "863754cf6f5dbc0256c799fec3a2aa3557226645240689f6da1ae420bbc23892",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105902121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e64b1525afb1cfdb2dc0f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若身处中团以后的位置\\n一段时间内加速度持续提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "174fea82b7df59a86a626106aab800eaac40c9a64c30fe64fe7fdbd87ff46e38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105902211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b6969449f3b857f927ffff6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时前方遭遇阻挡时\\n一段时间内加速度持续提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "01bc75d94611e853f04165bd299e957acb3d22aee5e65996ad97817de2c17880",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76b969592f1654698bd6a4d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时,一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f466f21d5664bb5e0910aa9c788c5ec7a72b4b590f4f4ab66153694689ccdbe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6e48b69f6396df800824935",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf0d3fe486a43e7f6e7dcccf7b8f4fc7a21e0f8cae7cd8d1be2b6b5427d35e66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:414de0a46e69a00ce33d79e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段时前方堵塞时\\n加速力提升,跑道选择稍微变得明智\\n并且稍微回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c1c2fa54419d44befb38af16f7ddbc191c5481edec53cff1c0a0cdb83db138",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3cdf911a6d46c760b174343",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跑位贴紧前方赛马娘时\\n速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "355d67d80ba53973d0c8b85df59718d19415e8b7b6b11feb4023d0eeafed3f04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106003111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b5785986d619a842e6f1b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于队伍中后方时\\n一段时间内加速度提升\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "db843e24189ccfcb674629a4c947b7e117f45abb70839cc39c74ba4c14d12afb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106003211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b442d6368ae5bc794cd00cf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期若位于中后方\\n则更早时间内稍微提升加速度\\n并小幅向前突进＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa1bcdf5eadefbf97cdb94eaca47b3e3086a19781e0ada712901a6085bba245",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106003221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff55dc641c98984ac1788a06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘处于第三名快要输掉的时候\\n激发昂扬斗志,速度少量加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "430997572a4b77d2219d7f94104d883bbda0a7ece21eb53c7958cc30aef418ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6b96799637c5f7a1bc149ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时身处后方时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升\\n并且加速度微幅提升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "af9f9bee9b2c854db1d11f73d30c1d0ae0a997b7a90f2d70c8971425b5e2dc25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82ccb1a85a9d0d5b63b1e184",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,视野变得广阔\\n并且速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "00cc1a5d5f226bfffc65f49c440dbe06feb1063501e1f9e961c4cae143069ae0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aadf370d599fc6ebb19fb29b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上自外道完成超越时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b163af1933120d16953abf3a44d8fa05bc28e74a9bfee94565c37c55e17985e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aab924476106938d7e2c0ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "非常擅长春季的比赛\\n速度与力量大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "75617cd1166cbed1997140c9f87767bf7c728269c956d67cc23469fc1cfdecbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a905d9ba8a86263f7bc28fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘加速度提升\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a697e3d66fb7bc99a9b047d058765ef21868797ba0de7bd797deab0b882218b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106103111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac03d4b50851877c294988d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的时候若位于中后方\\n速度大幅提升＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d95a40857ab7d2d55a502d0393cf2f94faad58219aba58f593821517ba9deae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106103211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aab5c42defed1fc91a8dfa5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时位于中后方\\n则一段时间内速度提升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a91b3f89b52434c64426825145b243101def1cb5783edeb13c84077cb708339e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106103221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29fb734bb57528cbce84fc56",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够冷静地进行比赛的规划时\\n就能够在最后200米发挥实力,大幅加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fdefbed2b57ee35b79b7eecbce81b6563f6e361b0a3a6effe165b2159056f9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb6187ee1315652e3436b870",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若被团团包围\\n回复持久力,并稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "178c8bc712a5c1d40b864f08fb6bf9bb7f664be5ab14d74b7ad69b8e152e96b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df8914d2213890aa5502186",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘完成超越时,速度提升\\n并且微幅提升加速度、\\n稍微回复持久力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a279ed645e3994f87a8ba7f79c9d37f3a8b2d7c47e91658948ea585e0cf89b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:202862cf520629b1ad3e5f1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘前半段\\n回复大量体力\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8c392fbc0c35079cbcd5b20c678de193abbdb27496520df7fe86ef308e83f3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a38662df70cb28ab5a24f28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于中后方时\\n一段时间内提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b25668f6aee2c3ad419fabf79c26e99978693c1036222dc19baee14dd10cfd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:759a4d6641a1666c666aa759",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段若位于队伍中后方\\n则提升加速度,之后在比赛进入\\n最后300m时速度稍微提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef8fecebe110fe2354577f717664fbe824259679f7f8936ba45f6116c61da2ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106202221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a253c80d30d6177312ba5485",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中期左右处于队伍中团时\\n重新振作,稍微回复持久力\\n并且略微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d2953c69a4be255bb94386a77ff5b36ef55972c9c567ad40451288c2024975",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10621"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07cd56d4ce9094eb00c77d40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段回复大量体力\\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e075e4a8211a0f0ac5b588ccdf42f845ae4fa6c1e758b16987e5e704a201593f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b155e1b01731a8431113f142",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段消耗少量体力\\n使速度极大提升＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "df886333a4a61d714f33fefec969f880c9f413ecdde3a96f433328f535156849",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d3f8911c448baad63741bfe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度和力量充分强的话\n所有基础能力提升<英里/中距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f2833b0ed2a123ee929184de40cdccfdf92b5614a84abc4767bef975d9a951",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef3c84cf1c693c94a3a93ee3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘迫近时\n若位于前方则提升速度\n若是中距离比赛则额外\n稍微提升速度<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9dd51ce14e9185ba3d887b4d73836c7819bb73d901115c4af11e5e9e405aa00",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09db0b5b97ed836fa6e03530",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n会持续稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6410678605325a652f31b56d257b08331d7fe06c88abefb1df77f3643c12853f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10631"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7334f95bf8a44ccf70263c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当有赛马娘长时间跟随身后时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "77e82f431d3cba956e95e93952176ecc287d5db18ace68b708d957d730168742",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a99340bf2da51c887385abd2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘以较大差距保持领先时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b8224228dcac689e886fe8593c2f14a98141f5b7e185171256b81a3c929ef2a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef21273fa03729e26cb15786",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘进行竞争时\\n速度大幅提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "71c659f9b4a329d4b721620b0524823d57a6ab44eb884861201a513e82c4a843",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106401221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df2672065fc4473a8293e41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在直线一段时间内速度提升\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f6e12141d4ac19833c47b429bd218eaec3d6024c365020b6f746a552f58835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca7aaed6897dc09f8791ac20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘大幅提升速度\\n并少量回复体力\\n若在中山竞马场心情绝好调\\n会提升回复量＜爆领・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6409c1e5f13e0ebe8a4f6e7666e22d5f18caaa00d08fc1d3a7a9d767b7906680",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf088040903fad85f09aa3b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d7eb2abba4a5969c476b5ad7dde9710acc568b354dc0f24d4f1f7a907e13bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3094284e24511ad16ea61a8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b515e441c104a3ce2a8d50635c1bbfd02b89ef256c36d7b21863cae4be840614",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a731a3d7ddaa0c13b75fcc4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑时加速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eef3f148c31dbd9d0bb9c58d8bbad55cd4af12eaf11cd410dde6d6917e0f148",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106502111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94fb0cc0a4795a120ff34c53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘处位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6900501bcbde89e75c43f0a15c9354348fbae99354b0e8b0e907f788a501ef0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e1be7b6b49f4bca92ffe9d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘开始时\\n大幅消耗持久力\\n使速度超大幅提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9da1ab35bc92e4009bfced1db5043128111ce5c15c6ad0c900af6bc2b795b3ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d34f1c540c9b5e7f7fd43771",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时,加速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a202b19ce79270ed21a55733bef718be704030c3505488c82d5dc94c27e0c45c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399b0b06a02191935f7455f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘中段处于领头位置时\\n超长时间内速度持续微幅上升\\n但终盘末段时会微幅逆喷射",
      "source_fingerprint": "0536f8b0a3c5e41556d358bea53b0bc448cdabb1caf960aaed3975b285b1aa9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69adf877153ce4e9dad0eac9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处中间集团以后\\n回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "176a344d6e492d30ee316fe946089083179d4b3e83b1bfae507fd0279367abe9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:592f29dc74a95041328778cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛临近中盘位于中后方时\\n回复少量体力并提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f9b97676004bdb86c2e6440fa8eba017320cc56e54b828a24f24c5f60c6172",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106701121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:228d0d0a0ffe337e991afd88",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "非常擅长顺时针的赛道\\n速度与力量大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "660c0978224b5bb91a7896a22d12c32a9b70f9270d056274afb8b415c122d85f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c9482cf8e6355eb3f4d9624",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时若身处中间集团以后\\n微幅消耗持久力\\n提升加速度＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb37e0a07c1786f085b2f8ed15523685e89401a290e54371ff3bbf8193d761f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33d6778592eb9d5b8825b2f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n稍微剥夺前方赛马娘的持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0083b2cbba82efa6031345f63ecbddc9cfe02591afd14205e3428ec02cae26f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef489a847eac9e8ef77b4ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于中后方时\\n一段时间内提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b25668f6aee2c3ad419fabf79c26e99978693c1036222dc19baee14dd10cfd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106703111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7b5d758599e061954e17650",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在弯道的速度大幅提升\\n且在隆尚竞马场心情绝好调时\\n技能持续时间增加＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "397b366b7330938d1c255c997ff1d5dedc116b50941711cd3ca9610fb241d94e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106703211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25b6146d40e23f9654f00f8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时,加速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a202b19ce79270ed21a55733bef718be704030c3505488c82d5dc94c27e0c45c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "106801111"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
